# Champion of the Path (CR 601.2b, 701.4a, 603.2, 120.3, 607.2q): the additional cost beholds a Regathan Firecat from the hand and
# exiles it. The Champion itself entering triggers nothing ("another"), but the second Firecat Bot1 casts does: it deals 4, its
# power, to Bot2 (20 -> 16). Bot2's own Firecat entering does not trigger it ("you control"). When Bot2's Swords to Plowshares
# exiles the Champion the beheld Firecat returns to Bot1's hand.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus x2
Mox Ruby
Regathan Firecat x2
Champion of the Path
Mountain
Mountain x10
[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Regathan Firecat
Swords to Plowshares
Plains
Plains x10
